==Battleground==
*2 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

